    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39353" root="نجب" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْجَابٌ</span></b>  A <i>weak</i> man: (S, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَاجِيبُ</span>.
(TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْجِبٌ</span>, and also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْخَابٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْجَابٌ</span>
An arrow <i>that has neither feathers nor head;</i>
(A'Obeyd, S;) <i>that is trimmed, shaped,</i> or <i>pared,
but has neither feathers nor head.</i> (As, A'Obeyd,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْجَابٌ</span> <i>An iron with which a fire is
stirred.</i> (K.)

